## What `qualityBand()` Actually Does (Current Code)

```java
if (length >= 200 && length <= 900)  return 0;   // preferred
if (length >= 120 && length <= 1100) return 1;   // marginal
return 2;                                         // undesirable (< 120 or > 1100)
